        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "html": "Road Map",
          "align": "center",
          "size": null
        },
        {
          "type": "row",
          "cols": [
            {
              "span": 3,
              "content": []
            },
            {
              "span": 6,
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "I started the Little Martians project in 2020, right when the pandemic hit, the year 0 of <a href=\"https://mars.college\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mars College</a>. It’s been a continuous development ever since and now I believe to have a clearer vision of how it will blossom in the long term.&nbsp;",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "What I love about this project is that I can merge all my different passions in one consistent narrative. Painting, sculptures, installations, storytelling, world history, philosophy, speculative science, sci-fi, experimental tools, AI, autonomous beings, blockchains, copyleft, animations, music, even rituals and food (in the the form of edible sculptures), all of these are part of the Little Martians world.&nbsp;",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "This fictional world has also been a great framework to collaborate with other people. There have been a few interactions of collective creation with Little Martians at Mars College with delightful outcomes. Most notably, Gene Kogan has been my deepest collaborator. We’re constantly learning together what is possible to create with AI and I’m very happy that we’ve been a source of inspiration for one another.&nbsp;",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "What I’m most excited about the Kojii collection is the interactive storytelling component. I’ve created a world, set the context and parameters and now I ask people ‘what is happening with each character?’ I want to be inspired by others. Collaborative storytelling possesses a unique power: the more artists and creatives a fictional universe attracts, the more robust it becomes.&nbsp;",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "For the remainder of 2024, my focus will remain on developing these six characters. Each has a song, and Verdelis already features in an introductory animation. Plans are underway for a children's book detailing Verdelis's backstory, and I aim to produce more animations. Additionally, I intend to compile a book from the Kojii generations that significantly advance the narrative. Having co-founded a publishing company in Brazil with my parents in 2010, I am well-versed in book production. I also envision exhibiting the main characters' sculptures in immersive installation settings. Moreover, I've been commissioned to create educational content on AI and Art, with a focus on the Little Martians project",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "This endeavor is more than just an artistic project; it is a spiritual practice. It reflects my love for the world and humanity, acknowledging our inherent limitations and situating our lives within a broader, mysterious narrative.&nbsp; And it 's fun.&nbsp;",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "So, dear reader, I invite you to play with my model. I would love to be surprised with your creations.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "with love,",
                  "align": "right",
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "Vanessa",
                  "align": "right",
                  "size": null
                }
              ]
            },
